Export fidlgen_rust's goldens to the overlay's golden test (milestone M7).

tests/fidlgen compares fidlgen_rust's output on upstream fidlc's IR goldens with these
files, as upstream's fidlgen_rust_golden_tests (BUILD.gn) does. Bazel does not export
source files implicitly here, and upstream's BUILD.bazel names no goldens. The added
lines are the overlay's (Apache-2.0); the context lines are Fuchsia's (BSD-2-Clause,
LICENSES/BSD-2-Clause.txt). Applied by scripts/regen.py after 0001.

diff --git a/tools/fidl/fidlgen_rust/BUILD.bazel b/tools/fidl/fidlgen_rust/BUILD.bazel
index 7f063c4..347a1a9 100644
--- a/tools/fidl/fidlgen_rust/BUILD.bazel
+++ b/tools/fidl/fidlgen_rust/BUILD.bazel
@@ -22,3 +22,8 @@ go_binary_host_tool(
         "//vendor/fuchsia/tools/fidl/lib/fidlgen",
     ],
 )
+
+exports_files(
+    glob(["goldens/*.golden"]),
+    visibility = ["//tests/fidlgen:__pkg__"],
+)
